@startuml getDetailedLoggingIsOnAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getDetailedLoggingIsOnAsync – Retrieve Detailed Logging Status
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "Operation Client Interface" as oci #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
   operation-client UUID.
end note

requestor -> oci: (operationClientUuid)
activate oci

oci -> jd: read logical-termination-point
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> oci: Operation client LTP List 
deactivate jd

note over oci
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Locate interface by operationClientUuid  
  - Read detailed-logging-is-on attribute  
  - Return boolean value  
  - Return undefined if attribute not present
end note

oci --> requestor: detailedLoggingIsOn | undefined
deactivate oci

@enduml
